::CW_U04_L08_UA_Q01::Unit 4 assessment item. Poem/context: The last bus sighed away, leaving light on the wet street. Which answer shows the strongest Unit 4 reading approach?{
~Guess a theme without evidence.#Incorrect. Interpretation must be evidence-based.
